{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/901318-gm-l-f-3-5-players-for-skype-hunter-orpheus-game","id":901318,"title":"GM l/f 3-5 Players for Skype Hunter/Orpheus game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-27T13:30:08-07:00","id":901318,"title":"GM l/f 3-5 Players for Skype Hunter/Orpheus game","content":"::: Introduction<br /> <br /> Hi! My name is Ashley and I'm a 27 year old call center employee for T-Mobile. In my spare time I plan and run larps, the occasional tabletop and play video games. I'm here because I'm working on third LARP, to start after my current one ends and need to get more familiar with the systems. To protect the locals from spoilers I'm approaching ya'll for a skype/rpgtools/diceroom game! I would like to run it at least twice a month. Beyond that we will negotiate<br /> <br /> ::: The Game<br /> <br /> I have adaptions for both Hunter and Orpheus to be used in a CofD MET setting and so we'll be using those. Each character is a part of the Orpehus Conspiracy (houseruled) and a compact (strongly suggest Union or Illumined Brotherhood). Ghosts are the focus. Geists do not exist and the Underworld cosmology is replaced with that of the Shadowlands from the Wraith setting from WoD but is as of yet unknown to anyone in the PCs' social circles. Ya'll will be in a cell and work together. No backstabbing. Very investigative and losts of RP with a nail biting pace and potentially a bit of a meat grinder if the characters are not careful. Very adult with dark themes.<br /> <br /> ::: Looking For<br /> <br /> Three to five adult players with patience for me figuring out a new line, don't mind house rules and have not studied the Orpheus books. I would like to start char gen this weekend.<br /> <br /> Ya'll can reply here and/or message me on skype via gordonaa89","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link"